# Controlled vocabularies application profile; maintainer: GitHub jakubklimek
RewriteEngine on

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle [NC]
RewriteRule ^$ https://mff-uk.github.io/data-specification-vocabulary/dsv-dap/cv/dsv.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteRule ^$ https://mff-uk.github.io/data-specification-vocabulary/dsv-dap/cv/ [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://mff-uk.github.io/data-specification-vocabulary/dsv-dap/cv/$1 [R=302,L]
